The {{Term/Store|Barbarian Set||Series, BotW, TotK}} is a recurring [[Armor Set]] in {{TLoZ Series}}.{{Exp Game|BotW, TotK}}<ref name="CaC 184"/><ref name="TotK Piggyback 52"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Descriptions BotW}}
The Barbarian Set is an [[Armor Set]] consisting of the [[Barbarian Helm]], [[Barbarian Armor]], and [[Barbarian Leg Wraps]]. Each piece must be obtained from a [[Treasure Chest]] in the following [[Ancient Shrine]]s respectively: 
*[[Tu Ka'loh Shrine]] at [[Lomei Labyrinth Island]].
*[[Dila Maag Shrine]] at [[South Lomei Labyrinth]].
*[[Qaza Tokki Shrine]] at [[North Lomei Labyrinth]].

Each piece increases Link's Attack Up by one when worn. If all three pieces are worn and have been [[Enhancing|Enhance]]d at least twice by a [[Great Fairy]], they provide the Charge Atk. Stamina Up [[Set Bonus]].

According to the item descriptions, the armor set was once worn by an ancient warlike tribe from the [[Faron (Region)|Faron]] [[Region]]. After obtaining them, [[Granté]] will begin selling each piece of the set for 4,000 [[Rupees]]. 

